# Captured screenshots + the generated Play listing tree (regenerated each run).
# NOTE: metadata/<locale>/ (the App Store listing text) IS committed — that's the
# source of truth deliver uploads from. Only the Android tree is generated.
screenshots/
metadata/android/
fonts/
# The App Review demo login. This repo is public, so the password must not be
# committed: the Fastfile writes both files from DEMO_EMAIL / DEMO_PASSWORD at
# upload time, the same secrets the screenshots workflow uses.
metadata/review_information/demo_user.txt
metadata/review_information/demo_password.txt
# App Store Connect API key material written by CI / local runs
keys/
*_framed.png
# fastlane run artifacts
report.xml
Preview.html
README.md
